  <item>
    <title>来，拆开这盒五颜六色的爵士</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696b96dfef1cf272a7ebfd78</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696b96dfef1cf272a7ebfd78</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 14:12:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>爵士乐最妙的就是——它不告诉你该想什么，</span><br><span>只是静静地，把合适的颜色递给你。</span></p><p><span>轻快的钢琴像柠檬黄，让人想起周末早晨的阳光；</span><br><span>低音贝斯缓缓铺开，是沉静的墨蓝色，像夜里安静的海；小号突然扬起一抹亮橙，整个人都跟着明亮起来。</span></p><p><span>不用懂那些复杂的乐理，</span><br><span>只要打开听听，哪段旋律染上了你今天的颜色。</span><br></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg6ablJZaBiwmQu9qJd7iLUyjMFk.jpg"></figure><p><span>祝各位收听愉快～💐</span><br><br><span>策划&amp;制作：Giantblue</span><br><span>小红书：@Groove Nest</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/651117d6871bfaa32f1be93d/lk-oR_4twxQjKFLiX5wY4KVKy5cd.m4a" length="37036533" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FksKSF_vXlJ9li3TEQMzsoaGMGVJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>2025.Dec | Winter jazz</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6954ba4c14db1df9efb5ce4d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6954ba4c14db1df9efb5ce4d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 06:07:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有时候想想，爵士乐在国内，本就是个相对安静的角落，听的人不多，玩的人更少。能够在这个角落里，用声音与一些人相遇，本身已经是件值得感激的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，格外想要感谢——感谢依旧愿意在某个时刻打开这期节目的你，来聆听这片并不喧闹的声音角落。这份陪伴，让我觉得，这一切都还是值得的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025年最后一期私人爵士歌单，感谢这一年的收听！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnqD0gc6iKWx0cff_OmwRIx0Fslp.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Playlist</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Stella Jang - snowy</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> Resavoir,Matt Gold,Mei Semones - Diversey Beach</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> Paul Desmond - Samba de Orfeu</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> Crazy Ken Band - 太阳 -Sunbeam-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> Cécile McLorin Salvant - What does blue mean to you</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 矢舟テツロー - It's You feat. Hanae Sakuyama</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> Robot Swing,LEO37,Flowstrong - TMSX</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 椎名林檎 - いとをかし</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> Cécile McLorin Salvant - Anything but now</span></p>]]></description>
